---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GuideList from '../components/GuideList.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import light from '../assets/studies/light.svg';
import still from '../assets/studies/still.svg';
const creators=(await getCollection('creators')).filter(c=>c.data.approved);
const notes=await getCollection('readingNotes');
---
<Base><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A journal of instant photography</p><h1>把此刻，<br/>留在相纸上。</h1><p class="lead">学习宝丽来、发现值得关注的创作者，在一张张即时照片里收藏自己的日常。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary" href="/learn/">从第一张照片开始</a><a class="text-link" href="/gallery/">浏览照片墙 →</a></div></div><div><div class="hero-art"><figure class="print back"><Image src={still} alt="抽象静物配色示意" width={600} height={600}/></figure><figure class="print"><Image src={light} alt="抽象光影配色示意" width={600} height={600}/><figcaption>01 / Light study</figcaption></figure></div><p class="note mt-3">原创视觉示意 · 非真实宝丽来照片</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Learn</p><h2>从这里开始学习</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/learn/">所有教程 →</a></div><GuideList variant="featured"/></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Discover</p><h2>值得关注的人</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/creators/">创作者名录 →</a></div><div class="empty creator-summary"><h3>{creators.length?`已收录 ${creators.length} 位创作者`:"慢慢整理，认真推荐。"}</h3><p>{creators.length?"从实拍、测光到双重曝光与相纸保养，在名录中找到不同创作者的公开主页。":"只收录经过站主确认的摄影创作者。名录等待第一批精选名单。"}</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Reading list</p><h2>精选笔记</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/notes/">全部笔记 →</a></div><div class="empty"><h3>已整理 {notes.length} 篇社区笔记</h3><p>从测光、拍摄经验到相纸保养和创作灵感。按主题查找原作者及原帖链接。</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / Collect</p><h2>一面照片墙</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/gallery/">进入展馆 →</a></div><p class="lead">按主题收藏照片与拍摄笔记。第一批真实照片等待站主提供。</p><a class="primary mt-6" href="/gallery/">查看展览布局</a></section></Base>

